# Comprehensive Audit & Elimination of Mock/Junk Data + Real-Data Pipeline Fixes

This implementation plan addresses all junk data, fake fallbacks, hardcoded numbers, and data pipeline bugs across the backend and frontend.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict "No Mock / Real Data Only" Policy:**
> Moving forward, if live real-time market data or financial statements cannot be fetched from Yahoo Finance / NSE exchange sources for a given ticker or query:
